## 1. Purpose

EnterpriseIdentity_Auth is a software project developed for educational, demonstrative, and portfolio reference purposes.

The project is intended to demonstrate software development concepts, including .NET, ASP.NET Core, JWT authentication, SQL Server, REST APIs, and Clean Architecture.

